<title>SOUTH KOREA: TABLE-Kum Kang H1 net profit soars.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Kum Kang H1 net profit soars.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30</p>
<p>    Shr (won)		 2,162    vs	 710</p>
<p>    Net			 29.54    vs	9.92</p>
<p>    Profit before tax     42.95    vs     15.22</p>
<p>    Turnover		 550.56    vs    489.72</p>
<p>Note - Kum Kang Development Industry Co Ltd is a distribution unit of the Hyundai Group. The figures were provided by the Korea Listed Companies Association.</p>
<p>-- Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5647</p>
